OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786382329
OL,3,CHow a diary entry from seven years ago
OL,4,Chelped solve a murder case
OL,6,FDetectives who spent years
OL,7,Finvestigating the disappearance of a
OL,8,FBarnsley man discovered he had been
OL,9,Fmurdered after finding a crucial diary
OL,10,Fentry from seven years ago.
OL,12,FRichard Dyson, who was 55, was
OL,13,Freported as missing by his daughter in
OL,14,F2019 and his whereabouts remained
OL,15,Funknown for nearly six years.
OL,17,FWith still with no evidence of his
OL,18,Fwhereabouts, a detective from South
OL,19,FYorkshire Police chased up a short
OL,20,Ftelephone call that had taken place
OL,21,Fthree days after Mr Dyson went missing.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
