PN,33502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786382329
OL,3,CHow a diary entry from seven years ago
OL,4,Chelped solve a murder case
OL,6,FThe call - which only lasted 39
OL,7,Fseconds - was between an innocent
OL,8,Flocal man and Christopher Wright, who
OL,9,Fhas now been jailed for Mr Dyson's
OL,10,Fmurder.
OL,12,FNot only could the local man remember
OL,13,Fthe phone call, but he had written a
OL,14,Fdiary entry at the time noting that
OL,15,FWright left an old trailer on his land.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
