SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786382329
OL,3,CHow a diary entry from seven years ago
OL,4,Chelped solve a murder case
OL,6,FDetective Constable Tom Ryan said: "I
OL,7,Fthought if I asked 'do you remember a
OL,8,Fcall you got six years ago, lasting 39
OL,9,Fseconds', he would definitely say no,
OL,10,Fbut not only did he say 'yes I
OL,11,Fremember', he also had it written down
OL,12,Fin a diary.
OL,14,F"He kept a diary about all comings and
OL,15,Fgoings on his land and then explained
OL,16,Fhow Wright had never come back to
OL,17,Fcollect his trailer.
OL,19,F"He then asked me if I wanted to go
OL,20,Fand see the trailer.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786382329
OL,3,CHow a diary entry from seven years ago
OL,4,Chelped solve a murder case
OL,6,F"At this stage, all the pieces fell
OL,7,Finto place in my mind and I knew that
OL,8,FI had found Richard."
OL,10,FDC Ryan went down to the trailer,
OL,11,Fwhich was parked close to hedges, and
OL,12,Ffound a blue barrel which had bones
OL,13,Fprotruding out.
OL,15,F"After all these years - Richard was
OL,16,Fdiscovered", said DC Ryan.
OL,18,FWright, 73, was jailed in August 2026
OL,19,Ffor a minimum of 35 years for
OL,20,Fmurdering Richard Dyson.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
