FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786382329
OL,3,CHow a diary entry from seven years ago
OL,4,Chelped solve a murder case
OL,6,FSheffield Crown Court heard Mr Dyson
OL,7,Fhad been living in a car on Wright's
OL,8,Ffarm and was doing odd jobs for him,
OL,9,Fbefore the pair fell out when Wright
OL,10,Faccused him of stealing and selling
OL,11,Fhis possessions.
OL,13,FWright had shot Mr Dyson in the arm
OL,14,Fand chest, before dismembering his
OL,15,Fbody and placing him inside the blue
OL,16,Fbarrel. He then filled it with cement
OL,17,Ffrom a builder's merchant.
OL,19,FHe left the barrel in a trailer and
OL,20,Fstored it with an innocent neighbour.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
