FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786382329
OL,3,CHow a diary entry from seven years ago
OL,4,Chelped solve a murder case
OL,6,FThe judge, Mr Justice Cotter, said to
OL,7,FWright: "You had worked as a butcher
OL,8,Fand were skilled enough to do such a
OL,9,Fterrible thing, something few ordinary
OL,10,Fpeople would have the stomach for."
OL,12,FWright also roped in his childhood
OL,13,Ffriend Karl Schwalbe, 72, to help
OL,14,Fconceal the crime.
OL,16,FSchwalbe was convicted of conspiring
OL,17,Fto pervert the course of justice and
OL,18,Fwas jailed for three years.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
